"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Il-limiti tal-veloċità, il-konnessjonijiet għal kull torrent, l-islotts tat-tniżżil u ż-żerriegħa huma stabbiliti għal kull torrent meta żżidhom, jew aktar tard taħt l-issettjar tat-torrent. It-torrents jużaw il-proxy mit-tab Konnessjoni (HTTP jew SOCKS5, jew il-proxy tal-Mac b'\"Uża l-issettjar tas-sistema\") u l-limitu tal-veloċità għat-tniżżil kollu. Il-bidliet japplikaw għat-torrents mibdija wara. Il-pari u t-traċċaturi jistgħu jaraw l-indirizz IP tiegħek, jew il-proxy tiegħek.";
