"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Il-backup iżomm is-settings tiegħek, is-settings tas-sit, il-kjuwijiet u l-lista ta' dak li tniżżilt, il-passwords u l-cookies qatt ma jitqiegħdu f'backup.";
